# text_field_selected.png: the text field once test/selected.txt has dragged the mouse across its first word.
# Rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with Impeller, given the
# same edits above the engine (test/text_field_test.dart); against
# fl-engine's frame given them as input events, both at DPR 3 with Roboto
# from the Flutter cache. Percent of pixels allowed to differ in any
# channel, and by more than 32.
#
# The differences are glyph edges, as text.tolerance's, and on lavapipe the
# selection's highlight: a translucent fill whose blend rounds one level
# down in one channel there (193 for the golden's 194), over the whole
# highlight, which is 1.9% of the frame. A GPU that rounds as Impeller's
# run did leaves the glyph edges alone, 0.231%. Measured 2026-11-16,
# lavapipe: 2.060% differ, 0.009% by more than 32.
differ 2.5
differ_over_32 0.05
